              'SOMEONE ELSE’S BODY, SAFETY AND PRIVACY ARE NOT YOURS TO TAKE.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 74801),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 77463),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked towards the approaching men.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 77463),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 84207),
          text:
              'He suddenly understood that this episode was going to be more serious than the others.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 84207),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 87138),
          text: 'The dreamworld pulled them closer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 87138),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 91683),
          text: 'They could now see the guests inside Lut’s home.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91683),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 93640),
          text: 'They appeared calm.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 93640),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 98000),
          text: 'Lut (A.S.) was not calm.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 98000),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 107760),
          text:
              'The Qur’an tells us that when the messengers came to Lut, he felt distressed and troubled because he did not yet know who they really were.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 107760),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 109720),
          text: 'He knew his town.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 109720),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 112240),
          text: 'He knew how people behaved.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 112240),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 114345),
          text: 'And he feared for his guests.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 114820),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 115890),
          text: 'Imaan whispered:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 115890),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 121832),
          text:
              '“He is worried because he knows what the people might try to do.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 121832),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 122947),
          text: 'Nadir nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 122947),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 125483),
          text: 'The crowd outside grew louder.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 125483),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 128626),
          text: 'Someone had heard about the visitors.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 128626),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 130210),
          text: 'Then others had come.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 130210),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 133472),
          text: 'And now men were hurrying towards the house.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 134486),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 136209),
          text: 'Akhlaq’s face tightened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 136209),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 138424),
          text: '“Why would they do that?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 138424),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 140311),
          text: 'The Compass displayed:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 140311),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 147624),
          text:
              'WHEN PEOPLE STOP RESPECTING ALLAH’S BOUNDARIES, THEY CAN ALSO STOP RESPECTING OTHER PEOPLE’S BOUNDARIES.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148424),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 150629),
          text: 'The men reached the house.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 150629),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 153464),
          text: 'Their intentions were shameful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 153616),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 158096),
          text: 'They wanted to approach Lut’s guests in a forbidden way.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 158541),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 162216),
          text: 'Lut (A.S.) stood between his guests and the crowd.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 162216),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 165336),
          text: 'He reminded his people to fear Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 165336),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 170376),
          text: 'He told them not to disgrace him concerning his guests.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 170376),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 177368),
          text:
              'He called them back towards what Allah had made lawful instead of the wrong behaviour they had chosen.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 177368),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 180568),
          text: 'But the crowd did not want correction.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 180568),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 183208),
          text: 'They wanted what they wanted.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 183997),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 185011),
          text: 'Akhlaq whispered:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 185011),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 189968),
          text: '“They think wanting something gives them permission.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 190538),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 192248),
          text: 'Imaan shook her head.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 192248),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 193600),
          text: '“It doesn’t.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 193600),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 196856),
          text: 'Suddenly the dreamworld froze.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 196856),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 199485),
          text: 'Everyone stopped moving.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 199485),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 202240),
          text: 'The shouting disappeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 202240),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 206084),
          text: 'Only Imaan, Akhlaq and Nadir could move.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 206084),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 209680),
          text: 'A new doorway appeared beside them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 210328),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 212704),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked at it suspiciously.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 213592),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 215672),
          text: '“Another lesson?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 215672),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 217432),
          text: 'Nadir nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 217432),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218712),
          text: '“Probably.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 218712),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 220301),
          text: 'They stepped through.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 220301),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 223392),
          text: 'They were standing in a school playground.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 223392),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 226430),
          text: 'Two children were playing with a football.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 226430),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 227992),
          text: 'A third child ran over.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 227992),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 229227),
          text: '“Give me the ball.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 229227),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 231792),
          text: 'The boy holding it shook his head.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 231792),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 233312),
          text: '“We are still playing.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 233584),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 236584),
          text: 'The other child grabbed for it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 236584),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 237304),
          text: '“Give it!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 237304),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 237544),
          text: '“No.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 237544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 239104),
          text: '“But I want a turn!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 239104),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 241504),
          text: '“You can have the next one.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 241504),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 244624),
          text: 'The child tried to pull the ball from his hands anyway.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 245344),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 247044),
          text: 'The Compass flashed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 247044),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 247045),
          text: 'WANTING DOES NOT MEAN OWNING.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 247045),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 248544),
          text: 'The scene changed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 249424),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 251504),
          text: 'Now a girl was opening her schoolbag.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 252395),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 256468),
          text: 'Another child reached inside.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 256468),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 259360),
          text: '“Don’t go through my bag.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 259360),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 261449),
          text: '“I’m only looking.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 261449),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 261770),
          text: '“No.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 261770),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 262734),
          text: '“But why?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 262734),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 263776),
          text: '“It’s mine.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 263776),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 266856),
          text: 'The Compass flashed again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 266856),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270916),
          text: 'CURIOSITY DOES NOT REMOVE PRIVACY.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270916),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 272596),
          text: 'Another scene.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 272596),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 275067),
          text: 'A child was sitting quietly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 275067),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279348),
          text: 'Someone came from behind and began tickling him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 279348),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279776),
          text: '“Stop!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 279776),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282085),
          text: 'The other child laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 282085),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 283657),
          text: '“It’s only a joke.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 283657),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 284181),
          text: '“Stop!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 284181),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 287195),
          text: 'But the tickling continued.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 287850),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 290208),
          text: 'Akhlaq immediately frowned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 290208),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 291808),
          text: '“He said stop.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 291808),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 293560),
          text: 'Nadir nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 293560),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 295880),
          text: '“And that should have been enough.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 295880),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 297720),
          text: 'The Compass displayed:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 297720),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 302440),
          text: 'A JOKE STOPS WHEN THE OTHER PERSON IS NOT ENJOYING IT.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 302813),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 306920),
          text: 'Imaan looked back towards the doorway leading to Lut’s town.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 306920),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 310760),
          text: '“So this lesson begins with small things too.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 310760),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 312580),
          text: 'Nadir looked at her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 312580),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 313360),
          text: '“What do you mean?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 313552),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 320152),
          text:
              '“If I learn that I can ignore people’s ‘no’ about their toys, bags or personal space…”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 321027),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 322152),
          text: 'Akhlaq continued:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 322152),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 326872),
          text:
              '“…I am learning that what I want matters more than their boundary.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 326872),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 328232),
          text: 'Nadir nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 328232),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 331312),
          text: '“And good character teaches the opposite.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 331312),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 333544),
          text: 'They returned to Lut’s town.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 333544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 336197),
          text: 'Everything began moving again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 336197),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 338544),
          text: 'The crowd was still outside.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 338544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 342544),
          text: 'Lut (A.S.) continued trying to protect his guests.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 342925),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 345306),
          text: 'Imaan felt uncomfortable watching.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 345306),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 348544),
          text: '“This is different from taking a football.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 348544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 350381),
          text: '“Of course,” Nadir said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 350381),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 353544),
          text: '“But the rule underneath is connected.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 354493),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 355343),
          text: '“What rule?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 355343),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 357894),
          text: 'He pointed towards the crowd.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 357894),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 364030),
          text:
              'Another person is not an object for you to use because you want something.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 364030),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 366492),
          text: 'The third mark filled halfway.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 366492),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 370463),
          text: 'One man in the crowd shouted.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 370463),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 375034),
          text: 'Others encouraged him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 379124),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 379125),
          text: 'Akhlaq recognised something from earlier Prophet stories.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 379125),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 379126),
          text: '“The group again.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 379126),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 379127),
          text: 'Imaan nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 379127),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 383448),
          text:
              '“People become braver at doing wrong when everyone around them is doing it.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 383448),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 385608),
          text: 'Nadir looked towards them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 385608),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 391208),
          text:
              '“And sometimes people do things in a crowd that they might have been ashamed to do alone.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 391208),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 392968),
          text: 'The crowd pressed closer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 393991),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 395520),
          text: 'Lut (A.S.) was distressed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 395520),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 397520),
          text: 'Then something changed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 397520),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 399520),
          text: 'The guests spoke.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 399520),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 401520),
          text: 'They revealed the truth.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 401520),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 404520),
          text: 'They were messengers from Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 404520),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 405520),
          text: 'Angels.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 405520),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 410520),
          text: 'They told Lut that the people would not be able to reach him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 411108),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 412520),
          text: 'Akhlaq’s eyes widened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 412520),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 416072),
          text: '“So Lut had been worried about protecting them…”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 416556),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 418249),
          text: 'Imaan smiled slightly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 418249),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 421272),
          text: '“…but they had been sent by Allah.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 421272),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 423592),
          text: 'The Compass glowed brighter.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 423592),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 425541),
          text: 'Then words appeared:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 425541),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 430952),
          text:
              'DO WHAT IS RIGHT EVEN BEFORE YOU KNOW HOW ALLAH WILL PROTECT YOU.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 430952),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 436844),
          text:
              'Lut (A.S.) had not known the ending when he tried to protect his guests.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 436844),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 439784),
          text: 'He had simply known his responsibility.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 440031),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 442004),
          text: 'They were under his roof.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 442004),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 444004),
          text: 'They had come as guests.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 444004),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 447904),
          text: 'And he would not willingly hand them over to wrongdoing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 448785),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 449918),
          text: 'Akhlaq whispered:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 449918),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 452184),
          text: '“That is courage again.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 452184),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 453905),
          text: '“Yes,” Imaan said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 453905),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 455644),
          text: '“But a different kind.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 455644),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 459531),
          text: 'A strange shadow crossed the wall behind them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 459531),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 461309),
          text: 'Nadir turned quickly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 461309),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 462148),
          text: 'The hooded traveller.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 462894),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 465598),
          text: 'He stood at the far end of the street.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 465598),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 468079),
          text: 'His reversed Compass was back.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 468768),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 469571),
          text: 'Akhlaq groaned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 469571),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 472096),
          text: '“I thought that thing broke.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 472096),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 475048),
          text: 'Nadir stared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 475048),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 475648),
          text: '“It did.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 475648),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 477328),
          text: '“Then what is that?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 477328),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 478408),
          text: '“I don’t know.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 478408),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 482759),
          text: 'The hooded figure lifted the dark Compass.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 482759),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 485568),
          text: 'Words appeared in the air:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 485568),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 486239),
          text: 'IF YOU WANT IT ENOUGH, TAKE IT.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 486239),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 489327),
          text: 'Imaan shook her head immediately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 489327),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 489595),
          text: '“No.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 489595),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 491072),
          text: 'Another line:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 491072),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 494760),
          text: 'THE STRONGEST PERSON GETS TO DECIDE.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 495507),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 497747),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked towards the crowd.',
