        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 620268),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 621453),
          text: 'Akhlaq frowned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 621453),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 623253),
          text: '“That is a difficult one.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 623253),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 624753),
          text: 'Nadir did not answer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 624753),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 626245),
          text: 'Imaan thought.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 626245),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 630245),
          text:
              'Then she looked towards the angry child they had seen earlier.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 630245),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 632345),
          text: '“People feel anger.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 632981),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 633745),
          text: 'Akhlaq nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 633745),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 638345),
          text:
              '“But Allah does not tell us to hurt people because we feel angry.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 638345),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 640345),
          text: '“People feel jealousy.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 640345),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 643445),
          text: '“But we do not spoil somebody’s blessing.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 643445),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 647470),
          text: '“We may want something that belongs to someone else.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 647470),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 649116),
          text: '“But we do not steal.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 649116),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 651200),
          text: 'Nadir smiled slightly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 651639),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 652517),
          text: 'Imaan finished:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 652517),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 658437),
          text:
              '“So the existence of a feeling does not automatically mean the action is permitted.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 658437),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 661945),
          text: 'The reversed message broke apart.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 661945),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 664829),
          text: 'The hooded traveller vanished.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 664829),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 668749),
          text: 'The fifth mark almost completed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 668749),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 672629),
          text: 'Then Nadir became unusually quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 673567),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 674879),
          text: 'Imaan noticed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 674879),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 675629),
          text: '“What?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 675629),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 677396),
          text: 'He did not answer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 678280),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 679669),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 679669),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 682829),
          text: '“Is this about that message from last time?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 682829),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 684829),
          text: 'Nadir looked towards the ground.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 684829),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 686036),
          text: 'YOU CHANGED ONCE TO BELONG.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 686036),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 687251),
          text: 'He sighed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 687251),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 693327),
          text: '“When I travelled before, I wanted people to like me.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 694390),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 695301),
          text: 'Akhlaq waited.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 695301),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 696726),
          text: 'Nadir continued.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 696726),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 700901),
          text: '“So sometimes I laughed at things I knew were wrong.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 701514),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 702494),
          text: 'Imaan listened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 702494),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 708885),
          text:
              '“And sometimes I agreed with people because I was afraid of being left out.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 709580),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 710573),
          text: 'Akhlaq said softly:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 710573),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 713840),
          text: '“That is what you meant by changing to belong.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 714493),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 716013),
          text: 'Nadir nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 716013),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 720399),
          text: '“After a while I stopped asking, ‘Is this right?’”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 720399),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 721983),
          text: '“What did you ask?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 721983),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 723933),
          text: '“‘Will they accept me?’”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 723933),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 726279),
          text: 'The Compass glowed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 727016),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 727605),
          text: 'Imaan said:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 727605),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 731022),
          text: '“So the desire was not only about bad behaviour.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 731965),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 733565),
          text: 'Nadir looked at her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 733565),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 733816),
          text: '“No.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 733816),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 737205),
          text: '“It could be wanting approval too.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 737205),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 737696),
          text: '“Yes.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 738843),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 740645),
          text: 'Akhlaq smiled sadly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 740645),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 742645),
          text: '“That one is harder to notice.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 742645),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 743645),
          text: 'Nadir nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 743645),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 751048),
          text:
              '“That is why self-control is not only about food, screens or anger.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 751048),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 753087),
          text: 'He looked towards Lut’s town.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 754174),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 761677),
          text:
              '“Sometimes the strongest desire is simply wanting everyone to accept you.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 761677),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 763877),
          text: 'The fifth mark completed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 763877),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 766064),
          text: 'Across the Compass appeared:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 766064),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 771005),
          text: 'DO NOT LET A DESIRE BECOME YOUR MASTER.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 771005),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 771643),
          text: 'Then:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 771643),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 774033),
          text: 'FEEL. THINK. CHOOSE.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 774033),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 776368),
          text: 'The town disappeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 776368),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 779805),
          text: 'They returned to Ibn Kathir’s library.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 780470),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 782466),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked at the Compass.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 782466),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 784781),
          text: '“Feel. Think. Choose.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 784781),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 786581),
          text: 'Ibn Kathir nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 786581),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 787901),
          text: '“A useful rule.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 788381),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 791621),
          text: 'Imaan explained what they had learned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 791621),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 796168),
          text: '“A feeling can be strong without being a command.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 796168),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 802061),
          text:
              '“A desire can exist without being right to follow,” Akhlaq added.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 802061),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 809033),
          text:
              '“And Allah’s guidance helps us decide what we should do with what we feel.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 809033),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 811493),
          text: 'Nadir looked towards the journal.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 811493),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 813673),
          text: 'It opened by itself.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 813673),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 815333),
          text: 'Ink appeared:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 815333),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 817533),
          text: 'FIVE MARKS ARE OPEN.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 817533),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 818131),
          text: 'Then:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 818131),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 820673),
          text: 'WRONG BECAME NORMAL.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 820673),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 822673),
          text: 'THE EYES WERE TESTED.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 822673),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 824673),
          text: 'BOUNDARIES WERE CROSSED.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 825225),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 827525),
